re, databases and high-performance flash arrays.</p><p>\n</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Every server we sell is [tested / fully refurbished / brand new] and configured to your exact requirements.<br><br></p><h2><b>Key Features</b></h2><ul><li>Extreme storage density: 24 x 2.5\" front hot-swap bays supporting SAS, SATA and NVMe</li><li>Up to 12 NVMe drives: Direct NVMe support for ultra-low-latency flash storage (backplane dependent)</li><li>Extra drive options: Optional mid-bay and rear 2.5\" drive cages for boot drives or additional capacity</li><li>Dual-processor performance: Up to two Intel Xeon Scalable processors (1st and 2nd Gen), up to 28 cores per CPU</li><li>Massive memory: 24 DDR4 DIMM slots, up to 3TB RAM</li><li>Enterprise management: iDRAC9 with Lifecycle Controller for remote monitoring, updates and deployment</li><li>Redundancy built in: Hot-swap redundant power supplies and cooling fans</li><li>Flexible expansion: Up to 6 PCIe Gen3 slots</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R630 Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r630-server","now":"85,000৳","old":"90,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R640 Enterprise Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r640-enterprise-server","now":"170,000৳","old":"175,200৳","single":""},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R730xd Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r730xd-server","now":"","old":"","single":"130,000৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R740 16 Bay SFF 2U Rackmount Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r740-16-bay-sff-2u-rackmount-server","now":"","old":"","single":"250,000৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R740xd 12 Bay LFF 2U Rackmount Server","href":"/dell-poweredge-r740xd-12-bay-lff-2u-rackmount-server","now":"","old":"","single":"270,000৳"},{"name":"Cisco UCS C220 M4 Rack Server","href":"/cisco-ucs-c220-m4-rack-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"Dell PowerEdge R530 Server","href":"/dell-poweredg